# Before you continue

Submit a correct answer to unlock the next page.

::: choice Which action comes first when you find a hazard? {name=safetyCheck scored required attempts=0 level=3}
(x) Stop work and isolate the hazard
( ) Continue working until the next break
:::

::: rule
if: block:safetyCheck.result isNot "correct"
then: disableCompletion because "Submit a correct answer before continuing."
:::

# Report the hazard
nav: Next steps

Tell your supervisor what you found and which control you applied.
